FROM node:24.19.0-bookworm-slim@sha256:a9f5f7c91a432850b2a8a7797adf5eadb6c733ceed61167806cee7ea7fbc29df
RUN apt-get update \
    && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends bubblewrap socat ripgrep git ca-certificates \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    && mkdir /workspace && chown node:node /workspace
COPY sandbox-probe.sh /usr/local/bin/omp-sandbox-probe
USER node
WORKDIR /workspace
ENTRYPOINT ["/bin/sh", "/usr/local/bin/omp-sandbox-probe"]
